Version 0.20.0:
	* Update CEF to version 151
	* Composite the CEF popup widget over the page: an expanded HTML select
	  list is displayed again
	* Display the hand or the forbidden cursor while dragging inside a page
	  with the HTML5 drag and drop
	* Fix keyboard input typed uppercase on Windows (#102)
	* Fix the non ASCII paths mangled on Windows: download folder and file
	  name, and the cache, locales, subprocess and log paths given to CEF
	* Decode as UTF-8 the strings coming from the web (URL, title, downloaded
	  file, dragged content and arguments of the JavaScript calls)
	* Escape the remaining control characters when JavaScript calls a Godot
	  method
	* Actually call CefShutdown() from shutdown() instead of leaking the
	  whole framework, and refuse to initialize CEF twice in a process
	* Report the CEF errors through get_error() instead of losing them, and
	  empty the buffer that get_error() is supposed to consume
	* log_fatal() no longer terminates the application
	* Protect the ad blocker rules shared by the Godot and the CEF IO threads
	* Treat a bare ad blocking rule holding a domain as a domain rule and
	  expose the filter list API: load_ad_block_filter_list(),
	  clear_ad_block_rules() and get_ad_block_stats()
	* Stop letting a web page grow the JavaScript bindings map without bound
	* Free the browser node when its initialization fails
	* Stop duplicating the whole page image at every paint
	* Detect the browser resize from the paint dimensions and fix an out of
	  bounds read in get_pixel_color() after a resize
	* Remove the texture property of the browser, use get_texture(), and fix
	  the hint of the audio_stream property: this removes the warning about
	  an instantiated ImageTexture used as a default value
	* Stop the interface of the 2D demo from growing when a page fails to
	  load
	* Update doc

